        "gRPC 走 HTTP/2 明文 (h2c)：f4 客户端魔法串 'PRI * HTTP/2.0\\r\\n\\r\\nSM\\r\\n\\r\\n' + SETTINGS；f5 SETTINGS+ACK；f6 SETTINGS ACK；f7 HEADERS (:method POST :path /svc/m :scheme http :authority 20.0.0.1:80 content-type application/grpc te trailers user-agent grpc-trafficgen/1.0 grpc-encoding identity grpc-accept-encoding identity gzip)",
